        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mervyn Peake, Robert Erskine Childers\n- Products: \"Gormenghast\" books, \"The Riddle of the Sands\", \"Asgard\"\n- Topics: British writers, Fenian revolutionaries\n\nFacts:\n- Mervyn Peake is best known for the books usually referred to as the \"Gormenghast\" books.\n- Robert Erskine Childers was born on 25 June 1870 and died on 24 November 1922.\n- Robert Erskine Childers was universally known as Erskine Childers.\n- Robert Erskine Childers was a British writer whose works included the influential novel \"The Riddle of the Sands\".\n- Robert Erskine Childers was also a Fenian revolutionary who smuggled guns to Ireland in his sailing yacht \"Asgard\".",
